<title>USA: Kent Electronics promotes Chapco as CFO.</title>
<headline>Kent Electronics promotes Chapco as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kent Electronics Corp said Thrusday it named Stephen Chapko as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kent said Chapko currently serves as vice president and treasurer.</p>
<p>Kent officials were not immediately available to comment on who Chapko replaces.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
